From aef9042a2157f37d212f187a14d4f480140bac8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 20:07:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(manifest): add `description` field for environments

Environments in the `[environments]` table can now carry an optional
`description`, which is shown by `pixi info` (and included in
`pixi info --json`). The JSON schema and the manifest reference docs are
updated accordingly.
